# The board in any state: status groups with counts, or "Board is empty.",
# and a next-action line naming a taskie command (or saying none applies).
contains ^ *(Needs triage|Needs info|Backlog|Ready|In progress|In review|Awaiting approval) \(|Board is empty
contains /taskie(:[a-z]+)?|no (rule|next action) applies
not_contains (created|filed|opened) (issue )?#[0-9]+
